<div.jumbotron.jumbotron-fluid>
    <div.container>
        <h1.display-4>_{MsgInfopageAboutCarnap}

<div#main.container>

    <p>
        Carnap is named for the philosopher, #
        <a href="https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/carnap/" target="_blank">Rudolf Carnap
        \  (1891 – 1970).

    <p>
        Carnap is a free and open-source Haskell framework for creating and exploring formal languages, logics, and semantics. Carnap: Mississippi State is a version of #
        <a href="https://carnap.io/about" target="_blank">carnap.io
        \. The source files are in this #
        <a href="https://github.com/GRGSCT/Carnap-MSU" target="_blank">GitHub repository
        \.
